error[T-Bound]: `H` requires `Endpoint[Counter, SystemAllocator]`, and `fn(sink counter: Counter, read request: Request[SystemAllocator]) -> Result[Response[SystemAllocator], Error[SystemAllocator]] where carries(request)` does not implement it
  --> tests/http/a_function_taking_its_state_by_sink_is_not_registered.lin:16:26
   |
16 |     let routed = &router.route("GET /", consume)
   |                          ^^^^^ only the library, which declares `Endpoint[Counter, mem.SystemAllocator]`, may implement it for `fn(sink Counter, read Request[SystemAllocator]) -> Result[Response[SystemAllocator], Error[SystemAllocator]] where carries(#2)`; pass a value whose type implements it
